[[Geography/Færrin/index|Færrin]]'s alternate planes are worlds joined to Færrin itself, not stops along the [[Geography/Færrin/Infinite Horizon/index|Infinite Horizon]]. They are the [[Geography/Færrin/Alternate Planes/Black and White/index|Black and White]], a dream world laid over the whole of Færrin, and the [[Geography/Færrin/Alternate Planes/Godhome|Godhome]], the realm beyond the [[Phenomena/Firmament|firmament]] where the dead of Færrin pass on. The [[Geography/Færrin/Alternate Planes/Black and White/Pharos|Pharos]] reaches both.
